# Rule 14 (ARCHITECTURE.md / RULES): files are UTF-8, LF -- enforced here,
# not by whatever core.autocrlf a given clone happens to carry.
* text=auto eol=lf
# PowerShell 5.1 and cmd need CRLF (reference_powershell_ascii_only); the
# index keeps LF, the checkout gets CRLF.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.gif binary
